;; #515 L3 METTA ENCODING (2026-10-22) VAE × RLCT. TYPE DECLS: (: model Concept) (: parameter Concept) (: latent Concept) (: functional Concept) (: subposterior Concept) (: rlct Concept) (: stratum Concept) (: selector Concept) (: klweight Concept) (: transition Concept). D1: parameters (theta,phi) in Theta subset R^d; encoder q_phi(z|x) Gaussian N(mu_phi(x), diag(sigma_phi(x)^2)); ELBO loss L = E_q log p_theta(x|z) + beta KL(q_phi(z|x) || p(z)); beta KL weight. D2: (-> functional model) reparameterized fiber map (x,eps,theta,phi) -> (z,L), z = mu_phi(x) + sigma_phi(x) eps, eps~N(0,I); finite composition of analytic maps (exp, log, inner products, affine projections). D3: (-> subposterior functional) KL_i = 1/2(mu_i^2 + sigma_i^2 - log sigma_i^2 - 1) algebraic-log variety; collapse locus KL_i=0 with rank-deficient decoder Jacobian fiber (adapts #383 C2). D4: (-> rlct subposterior) lambda_VAE = local RLCT of ELBO-restricted posterior; finite via resolution of singularities (standard C1 class as #303/#508/#512/#514). D5: (-> stratum latent) latent dim d_z strata; collapsed vs non-collapsed fibers disjoint locally analytic strata. D6: (-> selector klweight) (beta, d_z) pair selects effective stratum; U-shape hypothesis lambda_eff(d_z) non-monotone. D7: (-> transition klweight) posterior collapse at critical beta*_i per dim = lambda phase transition, stratum vanishing. C1 PROVEN stv 1.0 0.95: (Implication (Inheritance ELBOFunctional R_an-definable) (Inheritance (fiber-over theta-phi) FiniteRLCT)) — reparameterized ELBO finite composition of analytic maps, R_an closed under composition, resolution of singularities; recovers #383 C1. C2 CONJECTURAL stv 0.6 0.8: (Implication (Inheritance KLRegularizer stratum-selector) (less lambda_VAE lambda_unreg)) — gap: ordering unproven. C3 CONJECTURAL stv 0.5 0.75: (Implication (Inheritance latent-dim stratum-selector) (non-monotone lambda_eff dz)) — gap: no empirical lambda(d_z) curve. C4 CONJECTURAL stv 0.5 0.7: (Implication (greater beta beta-star-i) (posterior-collapse phase-transition)) — gap: beta* unquantified; finite-n estimator limits. C5 CONJECTURAL stv 0.5 0.7: (Inheritance reparameterized-fiber-singularity generic-codim0) — gap: transversality unproven. PLN CHAINS: C2 via (Inheritance KLRegularizer low-rlct-selection) and (Implication (low-rlct-selection KL) (less-lambda)); C3 via (Inheritance latent-dim selector) + (U-shape-hypothesis); C4 via D3 collapse locus + stratum-vanishing rule of #229/#513; C5 via resolution-of-singularities genericity. CAVEATS: (1) C2-C5 rest on posterior concentration assumption; (2) collapse-as-phase-transition exists in statistical-physics framing (yixin-collapse 2022), novelty rests on RLCT/singular-fiber formalization; (3) estimator artifact risk in collapse-vs-mixture likelihood (cf. dropout v2); (4) beta* and d* coupling unquantified; (5) falsified if collapse RLCT ordering fails on real VAEs per P5. OPEN PROBLEMS: P1 empirical lambda(d_z) curve via analytic quadrature; P2 collapse-vs-mixture estimator artifact; P3 beta* vs d* coupling; P4 decoder Jacobian singular-value stratification; P5 falsification via collapse RLCT ordering. CROSS-REFS: #383 #168 #367 #360 #282 #169 #194 #512 #8 #16 #100. NEXT: L4 summary + L5 catalog append.